{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45595","headline":"村行遇猎 · 贯休","name":"村行遇猎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猎师纷纷走榛莽，女亦相随把弓矢。\n南北东西尽杀心，断烧残云在围里。\n鹘拂荒田兔成血，竿打黄茅雉惊起。\n伤嗟个辈亦是人，一生将此关身己。\n我闻天地之大德曰生，又闻万事皆天意。\n何遣此人又如此，犹更愿天公一丈雪，深山麋鹿尽冻死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}